## Installation

Add `{{Codec.PackageRepoName}}` as a package dependency:

```bash
swift package add-dependency https://github.com/googleapis/{{Codec.PackageRepoName}}.git --from {{Codec.PackageVersion}}
```

Then add `{{Codec.LibraryName}}` to your target's dependencies:

```bash
swift package add-target-dependency {{Codec.LibraryName}} <target-name> --package {{Codec.PackageRepoName}}
```
